# HakiOS fragment: the Qualcomm SC7280 family (SM7325, QCM6490: "yupik", "kodiak") -- what is true of the SoC, whatever phone it is in.
# The processor has eight cores and the biggest is core 7; the temperature sensors, the chip-identity memory and the PMIC arbiter are
# at the addresses of this family (the kernel's defaults, which a port to another SoC overrides: soc_smem, thermal_tm0/1 ...).
# The sensors are read and the run is stopped at 105 degrees (CONFIG_THERMAL_STOP): this is the protection of a phone left alone.
CONFIG_SOC="sc7280"
CONFIG_CPUS=8
CONFIG_BOOTCPU=7
CONFIG_CPUFREQ=y
CONFIG_SOCINFO=y
CONFIG_THERMAL=y
